course: dictionary
lesson: 204
title: One word, two meanings: album
level: primary-5
stars: 0
explain: An album is a book with empty pages for keeping photos, stamps or stickers. «Think of a family photo album: the newest pages have clear photos, the oldest have only drawings and grandma's stories.» Here album is a book, and its pages hold the pictures.
explain: In music, an album is a set of songs put out together by a singer or a band. «Michael Jackson's album Thriller, from 1982, is widely reported as the best-selling album of all time» is about songs, not pictures. The clues are the year, the singer and the words best-selling.
explain: Context decides which meaning fits. Ask: is the sentence about pictures, stickers or songs? Then try your meaning in the sentence. Does «a set of songs» fit? Then it is the music meaning.
fact: An album is a book with empty pages for keeping photos, stamps or stickers.
fact: An album can also be a set of songs put out together by a singer or a band.
fact: A «photo album» can also be a folder of pictures on a phone.
fact: «Debut album» means a singer's first album, as in «Billie Eilish and her brother recorded much of her debut album on a computer».
fact: Check the clues around the word, such as pages, photos, songs, or the name of a singer or band, to tell which meaning you need.
exercise: «Think of a family photo album: the newest pages have clear photos.» What does album mean here? | A type of computer | A cake with icing | A set of songs put out by a band | *A book with empty pages for photos
exercise: «Taylor Swift re-recorded her early albums.» What does album mean here? | A bedroom at home | A folder of photos on a phone | A book for stamps only | *A set of songs put out together by a singer
exercise: «Billie Eilish recorded much of her debut album on a computer.» What does debut album mean? | An album of photos only | Her last album | An album with the most pages | *Her first album
test: «Think of a family photo album: the oldest pages have only drawings and grandma's stories.» What do the oldest pages have? | Clear photos from this year | Songs from a band | *Only drawings and grandma's stories | Stickers in rows
test: «Michael Jackson's album Thriller is widely reported as the best-selling album of all time.» What does best-selling mean? | Has the most pages | Is only for children | Was made in the 1960s | *Sold more copies than any other album
exam: Which is an album of songs? | A folder of pictures on a phone | A book of empty pages for stamps | A sticker book for school | *A set of songs put out together by a band
